{
  "views": [
    {
      "title": "Live",
      "path": "live",
      "icon": "mdi:video",
      "type": "sections",
      "max_columns": 2,
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Cameras",
              "icon": "mdi:cctv",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "picture-entity",
              "entity": "camera.YOUR_DEVICE_live_view",
              "name": "Front",
              "camera_view": "auto",
              "show_name": true,
              "show_state": false,
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "more-info"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "picture-entity",
              "entity": "camera.YOUR_DEVICE_rear_camera",
              "name": "Rear",
              "camera_view": "auto",
              "show_name": true,
              "show_state": false,
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "more-info"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "button.YOUR_DEVICE_refresh_snapshots",
              "name": "Take new photos"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "switch.YOUR_DEVICE_auto_refresh_snapshots",
              "name": "Auto refresh",
              "features": [
                {
                  "type": "toggle"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "Each card shows a photo — tap it to watch live. The dashcam streams one camera at a time over its own mobile data, so opening one stops the other. Photos are taken when this page first loads; use **Take new photos**, or switch on **Auto refresh**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Status",
              "icon": "mdi:car-connected",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "binary_sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_online",
              "name": "Online",
              "color": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "binary_sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_ignition",
              "name": "Ignition",
              "color": "amber"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_speed",
              "name": "Speed",
              "color": "blue",
              "features": [
                {
                  "type": "trend-graph",
                  "hours_to_show": 6
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_last_seen",
              "name": "Last seen"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "button.YOUR_DEVICE_update_location",
              "name": "Update location",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "toggle"
              },
              "color": "cyan"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Location",
      "path": "location",
      "icon": "mdi:map-marker",
      "type": "sections",
      "max_columns": 2,
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "column_span": 2,
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Where is it now",
              "icon": "mdi:map",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "map",
              "entities": [
                {
                  "entity": "device_tracker.YOUR_DEVICE"
                }
              ],
              "default_zoom": 16,
              "hours_to_show": 24,
              "theme_mode": "auto"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Trip",
              "icon": "mdi:speedometer",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_speed",
              "name": "Speed",
              "color": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_heading",
              "name": "Heading"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_altitude",
              "name": "Altitude"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_total_distance",
              "name": "Odometer",
              "color": "purple"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "History",
              "icon": "mdi:chart-line",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "history-graph",
              "hours_to_show": 24,
              "entities": [
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_speed",
                  "name": "Speed"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "binary_sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_ignition",
                  "name": "Ignition"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Media",
      "path": "media",
      "icon": "mdi:image-multiple",
      "type": "sections",
      "max_columns": 2,
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Latest event",
              "icon": "mdi:alert-decagram",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "picture-entity",
              "entity": "image.YOUR_DEVICE_last_event",
              "name": "Front",
              "show_state": true
            },
            {
              "type": "picture-entity",
              "entity": "image.YOUR_DEVICE_last_event_rear",
              "name": "Rear",
              "show_state": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "column_span": 2,
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Recent events",
              "icon": "mdi:view-grid",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "columns": 3,
              "square": true,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "picture-entity",
                  "entity": "image.YOUR_DEVICE_event_1",
                  "show_name": false,
                  "show_state": false,
                  "tap_action": {
                    "action": "more-info"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "picture-entity",
                  "entity": "image.YOUR_DEVICE_event_2",
                  "show_name": false,
                  "show_state": false,
                  "tap_action": {
                    "action": "more-info"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "picture-entity",
                  "entity": "image.YOUR_DEVICE_event_3",
                  "show_name": false,
                  "show_state": false,
                  "tap_action": {
                    "action": "more-info"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "picture-entity",
                  "entity": "image.YOUR_DEVICE_event_4",
                  "show_name": false,
                  "show_state": false,
                  "tap_action": {
                    "action": "more-info"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "picture-entity",
                  "entity": "image.YOUR_DEVICE_event_5",
                  "show_name": false,
                  "show_state": false,
                  "tap_action": {
                    "action": "more-info"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "picture-entity",
                  "entity": "image.YOUR_DEVICE_event_6",
                  "show_name": false,
                  "show_state": false,
                  "tap_action": {
                    "action": "more-info"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "Newest first. Tap a picture for the full image with its time, camera and location."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Recordings",
              "icon": "mdi:folder-play",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "**Media > Proof Plus** is the album: a grid of thumbnails you tap to view a photo full screen or to play a clip, the same as the app. **Cloud album** has everything; **Vibration**, **Collision** and **Share button** hold each kind of event. Each splits into **Videos** and **Images**, labelled by time and camera."
            },
            {
              "type": "button",
              "name": "Open media browser",
              "icon": "mdi:folder-multiple-image",
              "show_state": false,
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "navigate",
                "navigation_path": "/media-browser"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Messages",
      "path": "messages",
      "icon": "mdi:message-text",
      "type": "sections",
      "max_columns": 2,
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Latest",
              "icon": "mdi:message-alert",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_last_message",
              "name": "Latest alert"
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "Alerts arrive the moment the cloud sends them, so this list fills up from the day the integration was added rather than showing the app's older history. Choose which kinds you receive under **Settings > Alerts**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "column_span": 2,
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "History",
              "icon": "mdi:history",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "{% set alerts = state_attr(\"sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_last_message\", \"messages\") %}{% if alerts %}{% for a in alerts %}### {{ a.topic }}\n{{ a.text }}\n\n<font color=\"#888\">{{ as_timestamp(a.time) | timestamp_custom(\"%-d %b %Y, %H:%M\") }}</font>\n\n---\n{% endfor %}{% else %}No alerts yet. They arrive as they happen — ignition on and off, vibration, collision, the share button, geofence and over-speed — for whichever kinds are switched on under **Settings > Alerts**.{% endif %}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Settings",
      "path": "settings",
      "icon": "mdi:cog",
      "type": "sections",
      "max_columns": 3,
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Recording",
              "icon": "mdi:record-rec",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "switch.YOUR_DEVICE_record_voice",
              "name": "Record voice",
              "features": [
                {
                  "type": "toggle"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "switch.YOUR_DEVICE_time_lapse_parking_recording",
              "name": "Time-lapse parking",
              "features": [
                {
                  "type": "toggle"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "select.YOUR_DEVICE_time_lapse_recording_duration",
              "name": "Recording duration",
              "features": [
                {
                  "type": "select-options"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Detection",
              "icon": "mdi:motion-sensor",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "switch.YOUR_DEVICE_motion_detection",
              "name": "Motion detection",
              "features": [
                {
                  "type": "toggle"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "select.YOUR_DEVICE_motion_sensitivity",
              "name": "Motion sensitivity",
              "features": [
                {
                  "type": "select-options"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "select.YOUR_DEVICE_accident_sensitivity",
              "name": "Accident sensitivity",
              "features": [
                {
                  "type": "select-options"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "select.YOUR_DEVICE_car_idle_timing",
              "name": "Car idle timing",
              "features": [
                {
                  "type": "select-options"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Device",
              "icon": "mdi:cellphone-cog",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "number.YOUR_DEVICE_speaker_volume",
              "name": "Speaker volume",
              "features": [
                {
                  "type": "numeric-input",
                  "style": "slider"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "switch.YOUR_DEVICE_voice_messages",
              "name": "Voice messages",
              "features": [
                {
                  "type": "toggle"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "switch.YOUR_DEVICE_rear_camera_enabled",
              "name": "Rear camera",
              "features": [
                {
                  "type": "toggle"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "switch.YOUR_DEVICE_wi_fi",
              "name": "Wi-Fi",
              "features": [
                {
                  "type": "toggle"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "button.YOUR_DEVICE_refresh_settings",
              "name": "Read from device",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "toggle"
              },
              "color": "cyan"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "column_span": 2,
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Alerts I receive",
              "icon": "mdi:bell-ring",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "entities",
              "entities": [
                {
                  "entity": "switch.YOUR_DEVICE_alert_ignition",
                  "name": "Ignition"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "switch.YOUR_DEVICE_alert_vibration",
                  "name": "Vibration"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "switch.YOUR_DEVICE_alert_accident",
                  "name": "Accident"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "switch.YOUR_DEVICE_alert_share_button",
                  "name": "Share button"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "switch.YOUR_DEVICE_alert_car_idled",
                  "name": "Car idled"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "switch.YOUR_DEVICE_alert_geofence",
                  "name": "Geofence"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "switch.YOUR_DEVICE_alert_overspeed",
                  "name": "Overspeed"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Diagnostics",
              "icon": "mdi:stethoscope",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_device_temperature",
              "name": "Temperature",
              "color": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_free_memory",
              "name": "Free memory"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_sd_card_free",
              "name": "SD card free"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_sd_card_capacity",
              "name": "SD card capacity"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_internal_storage_free",
              "name": "Internal free"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_last_seen",
              "name": "Last seen"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "column_span": 2,
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Self-check",
              "icon": "mdi:clipboard-check",
              "heading_style": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_self_check",
              "name": "Result",
              "color": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_self_check_last_run",
              "name": "Last run"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "button.YOUR_DEVICE_run_self_check",
              "name": "Run now",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "toggle"
              },
              "color": "cyan"
            },
            {
              "type": "entities",
              "entities": [
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_sim",
                  "name": "SIM card"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_gsm_signal",
                  "name": "GSM signal"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "binary_sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_online",
                  "name": "Dashcam online"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "binary_sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_ignition",
                  "name": "Ignition sense"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "binary_sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_sd_card",
                  "name": "Sdcard"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "binary_sensor.YOUR_DEVICE_gps_fix",
                  "name": "Positioning (GPS)"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "Parked, the dashcam stops reporting to the cloud, so these show its last report — see **Last seen**. It still answers when asked: **Refresh settings** wakes it to read the settings and card. Ignition and positioning read as off while parked, which is normal and is not counted as a fault."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
